Value PEER (\S+)
Value PEER_AS (\d+)
Value IN_PKT (\d+)
Value OUT_PKT (\d+)
Value OUT_Q (\d+)
Value FLAPS (\d+)
Value LAST_UP_DOWN (\S+)
Value STATE (\S+)

Start
  ^Peer\s+AS\s+InPkt -> PeerTable
  ^\s*$$

PeerTable
  ^${PEER}\s+${PEER_AS}\s+${IN_PKT}\s+${OUT_PKT}\s+${OUT_Q}\s+${FLAPS}\s+${LAST_UP_DOWN}\s+${STATE} -> Record
  ^\s*inet\.\d+:
  ^\s*$$
